Define `UTF8PROC_STATIC` for every kb target in CMake, and in the Makefile so all platforms build utf8proc the same way (on clang/gcc it only drops a `visibility("default")` attribute, which changes nothing in an executable).

**Done when:**
- `cli/kb-cli/CMakeLists.txt` and `cli/kb-cli/Makefile` define it;
